# Scarcity Isle: the whole challenge ladder, played the Crafter's way. For each of the 18 goals of the guide's order
# (worlds/isle.json guide.goals.order) he asks the Apprentice the guidebook's own words, presses the top tile, then
# plays the goal with real inputs: chopping, crafting in the grid, building the cobblestone generator from the chest's
# ice and lava, mining, smelting, fighting, feeding. After each goal its advancement is asserted.
# Crafting first merges his stacks of an ingredient (a shift-click in his inventory), then puts one in each grid slot
# but the last, which takes the rest of the stack (a closed grid gives back what is left), and shift-clicks the
# result: exactly one craft.
# Every command that does part of what a goal is about is marked `# SHORTCUT: <why>`. Moving him to a spot on his own
# island with tp is marked once per spot ("walking there is not what the step tests").
# play-timeout: 1800
# Needs a Gate C carrier with `@click … right|shift` (jivinstev/mc-mod-version-upgrade#246); until a carrier release
# has it, build one from that branch and pass its folder as CARRIER_DIR (tools/play.sh).
@intent a player climbs all 18 goals of Scarcity Isle with the Apprentice's ready-made makes and his own hands
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive on his island
@expect chat How to use Moddy within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if entity @s[y=60,dy=12]
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@wait 2s
# the first player's island: its origin at -1024 63 -1024, so its template corner at -1027 63 -1025 (IslandPlacer)
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-1024,y=66,z=-1024,dx=0,dy=0,dz=0]
@assert execute if block -1020 66 -1024 minecraft:chest
@assert execute if block -1025 66 -1020 minecraft:oak_log
# setup: the Isle's goals pack. A world made with the Moddy Isle World Type has it from the start; the carrier makes
# its own world, switched on by properties, without the world's packs (tools/play.sh)
datapack enable "mod/moddyisle:datapacks/skyblock_advancements"
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/root=false}]
# setup: a survival player in daylight, kept safe from a fall into the void, fire and lightning
gamemode survival
time set noon
weather clear
gamerule doDaylightCycle false
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 3000 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:fire_resistance 3000 0 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 3000 0 true
@shot arrived

@step 1 Minecraft: oak saplings
moddy apprentice some oak saplings
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
# a make is finished when Moddy counts the wish ("… wishes left"); a make asked sooner hears "still on its way"
@expect chat /wishes left/ within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_sapling
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_sapling
# Please Drop... (goal 6) is earned by the sapling in his inventory
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/sapling=true}]

@step 2 Getting Wood: bone meal, and he chops his tree by hand
moddy apprentice some bone meal
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /wishes left/ within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:bone_meal
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
# SHORTCUT: stands at the middle of his tree corner (walking there is not what the step tests)
tp @s -1023.5 66 -1020.5 0 0
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim pos -1024.5 66.5 -1019.5
@key key.attack hold 80t
@aim pos -1024.5 67.5 -1019.5
@key key.attack hold 80t
# SHORTCUT: stands where the trunk stood (walking there is not what the step tests), to chop the rest looking up
tp @s -1024.5 66 -1019.5 0 0
@aim pos -1024.5 68.5 -1019.5
@key key.attack hold 80t
@aim pos -1024.5 69.5 -1019.5
@key key.attack hold 80t
@repeat 10 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_log
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_log
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/root=true,skyvoid_advancements:overworld/wood=true}]
@shot chopped

@step 3 Benchmarking: oak planks, a crafting table in his own 2x2 grid
moddy apprentice some oak planks
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /wishes left/ within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_planks
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@key key.inventory
@expect screen InventoryScreen within 3s
@click item "Oak Planks" shift
@click item "Oak Planks"
@click slot 2 right
@click slot 3 right
@click slot 4 right
@click slot 1
@click slot 0 shift
@wait 5t
# the table to his hand (hotbar 9), and his hotbar tidied: Moddy puts each new make in the first free hotbar slot
@click slot 39 shift
@click slot 40 shift
@click slot 41 shift
@click slot 42 shift
@click slot 43 shift
@click slot 44 shift
@click item "Crafting Table"
@click slot 44
@key key.inventory
@expect screen none within 3s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={minecraft:story/root=true}]
# SHORTCUT: stands at the middle of his island's long side (walking there is not what the step tests)
tp @s -1023.5 66 -1022.5 0 0
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim pos -1024.5 65.9 -1024.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@assert execute if block -1025 66 -1025 minecraft:crafting_table
@shot table

@step 4 Time to Mine: sticks, a wooden pickaxe at his table
moddy apprentice some sticks
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /wishes left/ within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:stick
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
# his stacks of each ingredient merged first (a shift-click from his inventory to his hotbar), so the next pick
# takes the big one
@key key.inventory
@expect screen InventoryScreen within 3s
@click item "Oak Planks" shift
@click item "Stick" shift
@key key.inventory
@expect screen none within 3s
@aim pos -1024.5 66.5 -1024.5
@key key.use
@expect screen Crafting within 5s
# table grid: slots 1-9 (row by row), result 0, his inventory from 10
@click item "Oak Planks"
@click slot 2 right
@click slot 3 right
@click slot 1
@click item "Stick"
@click slot 5 right
@click slot 8
@click slot 0 shift
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@expect screen none within 3s
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:wooden_pickaxe
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={minecraft:story/mine_stone=true}]
@shot pickaxe

@step 5 The Heart of the Grind: a water wand, the chest's ice and lava, a cobblestone generator
# his hotbar into his inventory, so the make lands in a free hotbar slot (a full hotbar sends it to the Wish Bag)
@key key.inventory
@expect screen InventoryScreen within 3s
@click slot 39 shift
@click slot 40 shift
@click slot 41 shift
@click slot 42 shift
@click slot 43 shift
@click slot 44 shift
@key key.inventory
@expect screen none within 3s
moddy apprentice a water wand
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /wishes left/ within 90s
@expect chat /water wand/ within 30s
@wait 2s
# the starter chest: shift-click out its lava bucket and ice
@aim pos -1019.5 66.5 -1023.5
@key key.use
@expect screen Container within 5s
@shot the-chest
@click item "Lava Bucket" shift
@click item "Ice" shift
@key key.keyboard.escape
@expect screen none within 3s
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:lava_bucket
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:ice
# the guide: a trench of four in the island's top (row z -1024), a hole under its second block
@aim pos -1023.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@aim pos -1022.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@aim pos -1021.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@aim pos -1020.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@aim pos -1022.5 64.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@assert execute if blocks -1024 65 -1024 -1021 65 -1024 -1024 200 -1024 all
@assert execute if block -1023 64 -1024 minecraft:air
# water: the ice put down at the trench's end and broken
@key key.inventory
@click slot 44 shift
@click item "Ice"
@click slot 44
@key key.inventory
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim pos -1023.5 64.95 -1023.5
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@assert execute if block -1024 65 -1024 minecraft:ice
@aim pos -1023.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@wait 1s
@assert execute if block -1024 65 -1024 minecraft:water
# lava: the bucket poured into the trench's other end
@key key.inventory
@click slot 44 shift
@click item "Lava Bucket"
@click slot 44
@key key.inventory
@key key.hotbar.9
@aim pos -1020.5 64.95 -1023.5
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@assert execute if block -1021 65 -1024 minecraft:lava
@repeat 15 until execute if block -1022 65 -1024 minecraft:cobblestone
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if block -1022 65 -1024 minecraft:cobblestone
@shot generator
# mine it with the wooden pickaxe, again and again: the pack counts each one and checks the lava is still there
@key key.inventory
@click slot 44 shift
@click item "Wooden Pickaxe"
@click slot 44
@key key.inventory
@key key.hotbar.9
@repeat 14 until execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/cobble_gen=true}]
@wait 2s
@aim pos -1021.5 65.5 -1023.5
@key key.attack hold 30t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/cobble_gen=true}]
@shot mined

@step 6 Please Drop: earned by the saplings (goal 1)
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={skyvoid_advancements:overworld/sapling=true}]

@step 7 Now That's Some Good Food: bone meal, leaves broken for an apple
